<title>FRANCE: Eurotunnel says sterling rise is positive.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel says sterling rise is positive.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurotunnel executive chairman Patrick Ponsolle said on Thursday that the British pound's rise was positive for the Channel Tunnel operator.</p>
<p>&quot;The rise in the pound is rather favourable for the company,&quot; he told shareholders at an extraordinary general meeting called to vote on a debt restructuring plan.</p>
<p>Ponsolle did not elaborate.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
